<title>SINGAPORE: L&amp;M Group in talks to sell Malaysian unit.</title>
<headline>L&amp;M Group in talks to sell Malaysian unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>L&amp;M Group Investments Ltd said on Monday it was still negotiating the proposed sale of its Malaysian associate company L&amp;M Corp (M) Bhd.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement it had received a bid for its shares in the Malaysian company and would make a further announcement when the sale was finalised.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
